'''Fantastical Parade''' (Japanese: '''夢幻パレード''' ''Dream Parade'') is the third {{TCGP|B Series}} expansion, and the fourteenth expansion overall, in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]].

== Information ==
'''Fantastical Parade''' is the sixth main expansion released through [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]], being the first main expansion to feature only a single booster pack. With an overall theme of a parade or festival, this expansion focuses on various Pokémon ex such as {{p|Gardevoir|Mega Gardevoir}} and {{p|Ogerpon|Teal Mask Ogerpon}}.

Fantastical Parade sees the introduction of {{TCGP|Stadium card}}s to Pokémon TCG Pocket.

